{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wilba quit his job as a soldier in the kingdom and returned to his hometown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then, the Demon King ordered his forces to launch surprise attacks and plunder the surrounding villages. The Demon King's army stormed Wilba's house and stole the Super Hoe, a family heirloom passed down for generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus, Wilba set out on a journey to the Demon King's castle to reclaim the stolen Super Hoe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses by clearing one stage to advance to the next. Defeat the boss waiting at the end of each stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use two attack methods: sword swings and javelin throws. Jump to dodge enemy attacks and eliminate foes hindering Wilba.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the Demon King's forces across all 4 stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat and Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies grants experience points and money. Accumulate enough experience to level up and make Wilba stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, use your money to purchase necessary items from the village shop to prepare for battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and use recovery potions to restore HP and food items that temporarily boost stats while in the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover useful items in the chests scattered throughout.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958550?t=1768170491","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958550?t=1768170491","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958550/38705e326221a9fc138cf339b27326a85a115ac6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768170491","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958550/38705e326221a9fc138cf339b27326a85a115ac6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768170491","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3961620,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wilba quit his job as a soldier in the kingdom and returned to his hometown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then, the Demon King ordered his forces to launch surprise attacks and plunder the surrounding villages. The Demon King's army stormed Wilba's house and stole the Super Hoe, a family heirloom passed down for generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus, Wilba set out on a journey to the Demon King's castle to reclaim the stolen Super Hoe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses by clearing one stage to advance to the next. Defeat the boss waiting at the end of each stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use two attack methods: sword swings and javelin throws. Jump to dodge enemy attacks and eliminate foes hindering Wilba.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the Demon King's forces across all 4 stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat and Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies grants experience points and money. Accumulate enough experience to level up and make Wilba stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, use your money to purchase necessary items from the village shop to prepare for battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and use recovery potions to restore HP and food items that temporarily boost stats while in the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover useful items in the chests scattered throughout.</p>","developers":["Yeonji Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co